#: source/how-to/spawn_prims.rst:7
msgid "Spawning prims into the scene"
msgstr "生成基本物体到场景中"

#: source/how-to/spawn_prims.rst:11
msgid ""
"This tutorial explores how to spawn various objects (or prims) into the "
"scene in Isaac Lab from Python. It builds on the previous tutorial on "
"running the simulator from a standalone script and demonstrates how to spawn"
" a ground plane, lights, primitive shapes, and meshes from USD files."
msgstr ""
"本教程探讨了如何从 Python 在 Isaac Lab "
"中将各种对象(或基本物体)生成到场景中。它基于先前的教程，演示了如何从独立脚本运行仿真器，并演示了如何生成地面平面、灯光、基本形状和来自 USD "
"文件的网格。"

#: source/how-to/spawn_prims.rst:17
msgid ""
"This tutorial automatically tetrahedralizes a volume deformable. Run it with"
" the ``tetrahedralization`` extra:"
msgstr "本教程会自动对体积可变形物体进行四面体化。运行时选择 ``tetrahedralization`` 可选依赖组："

